<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">appārĭtĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adp-</span></b> ),
			ōnis, f.
		appareo, III.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A serving</i>, <i>service</i>, <i>attendance</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in longā adparitione singularem fidem
					cognovi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 13, 54</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep. 75</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>, <i>household</i>, <i>domestics</i>, <i>servants</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex necessariis adparitionibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. ad Q. Fr. 1, 1, 4</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">Dig. 4, 2, 23</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
